---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="About Elitez FMCG | Singapore Brand Activation Team"
  description="Meet the Elitez FMCG team — the people behind Singapore's most deployed FMCG field marketing operation."
  canonical="https://fmcg.elitez.ai/pages/about"
  keywords="Elitez FMCG Singapore, field marketing agency Singapore, brand activation team, FMCG promoter agency Singapore"
>
<Fragment slot="head">
<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "Organization",
  "name": "Elitez FMCG",
  "url": "https://fmcg.elitez.ai/",
  "logo": "https://fmcg.elitez.ai/assets/logo-nav.png",
  "telephone": "+65 8180 0994",
  "email": "fmcg@elitez.asia",
  "address": {
    "@type": "PostalAddress",
    "streetAddress": "2 Kallang Ave, CT Hub #03-08",
    "addressLocality": "Singapore",
    "postalCode": "339407",
    "addressCountry": "SG"
  },
  "areaServed": "SG",
  "priceRange": "$$",
  "sameAs": [
    "https://www.linkedin.com/company/elitez-fmcg/"
  ]
}
</script>
</Fragment>
<style is:global>
  *, *::before, *::after { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
  :root { --orange: #FF5500; --orange-hover: #E84A00; --orange-pale: #FFF3EE; --black: #111; --white: #fff; --gray: #F4F4F2; --off-white: #FAFAF8; --mid-gray: #888; --border: #E8E8E5; --text-muted: #777; --nav-h: 72px; }
  html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
  body { font-family: 'Barlow', sans-serif; background: var(--white); color: var(--black); -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; overflow-x: hidden; }

  nav { position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; height: var(--nav-h); background: rgba(255,255,255,0.96); backdrop-filter: blur(12px); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); z-index: 100; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; padding: 0 48px; }
  .nav-logo { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; text-decoration: none; }
  .nav-logo img { height: 44px; width: auto; }
  .nav-logo-text { font-family: 'Bebas Neue', cursive; font-size: 22px; letter-spacing: 3px; color: var(--black); }
  .nav-logo-text span { color: var(--orange); }
  .nav-links { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 32px; list-style: none; }
  .nav-links a { font-family: 'Barlow', sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase; color: #888; text-decoration: none; transition: color 0.2s; }
  .nav-links a:hover, .nav-links a.active { color: var(--black); }
  .nav-cta { background: var(--orange) !important; color: var(--white) !important; padding: 10px 22px; border-radius: 3px; }
  .nav-cta:hover { background: var(--orange-hover) !important; }
  /* SERVICES DROPDOWN */
  .has-dropdown { position: relative; align-self: stretch; display: flex; align-items: center; }
  .has-dropdown > a { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 4px; }
  .has-dropdown > a::after { content: '▾'; font-size: 11px; opacity: 0.5; transition: opacity 0.2s; }
  .has-dropdown:hover > a::after { opacity: 1; }
  .nav-dropdown { position: absolute; top: 100%; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(-4px); background: var(--white); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-top: 3px solid var(--orange); border-radius: 0 0 4px 4px; padding: 4px 0; min-width: 220px; box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); opacity: 0; pointer-events: none; transition: opacity 0.2s, transform 0.2s; z-index: 200; }
  .nav-dropdown::before { display: none; }
  .has-dropdown:hover .nav-dropdown { opacity: 1; pointer-events: all; transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(0); }
  .nav-dropdown a { display: block !important; padding: 9px 18px; font-family: 'Barlow', sans-serif !important; font-size: 11px !important; font-weight: 700 !important; letter-spacing: 1.5px !important; text-transform: uppercase !important; color: #888 !important; background: none !important; transition: color 0.15s, background 0.15s !important; white-space: nowrap; border-radius: 0 !important; }
  .nav-dropdown a:hover { color: var(--orange) !important; background: var(--orange-pale) !important; }

  /* HERO */
  .about-hero { padding-top: var(--nav-h); background: var(--black); }
  .about-hero-inner { padding: 72px 48px 0; position: relative; overflow: hidden; }
  .about-hero-inner::before { content: 'ABOUT'; position: absolute; top: 0; right: -10px; font-family: 'Bebas Neue', cursive; font-size: 200px; letter-spacing: 8px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.02); pointer-events: none; line-height: 1; }
  .breadcrumb { font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 3px; text-transform: uppercase; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.3); margin-bottom: 20px; }
  .breadcrumb a { color: var(--orange); text-decoration: none; }
  .about-hero-inner h1 { font-family: 'Bebas Neue', cursive; font-size: clamp(56px, 7vw, 96px); letter-spacing: 3px; color: var(--white); line-height: 0.9; margin-bottom: 20px; }
  .about-hero-inner h1 span { color: var(--orange); }
  .about-hero-inner > p { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.5); max-width: 540px; line-height: 1.65; }
  .hero-img-strip { margin-top: 48px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 3px; height: 220px; }
  .hero-img-strip-item { overflow: hidden; }
  .hero-img-strip-item img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; display: block; transition: transform 0.4s; }
  .hero-img-strip-item:hover img { transform: scale(1.06); }

  /* STORY */
  .about-story { padding: 96px 48px; background: var(--white); }
  .story-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 80px; align-items: start; }
  .story-left {}
  .section-kicker { font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 4px; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--orange); margin-bottom: 12px; }
  .section-h2 { font-family: 'Bebas Neue', cursive; font-size: clamp(40px, 4vw, 60px); letter-spacing: 3px; color: var(--black); line-height: 1; margin-bottom: 24px; }
  .section-h2 span { color: var(--orange); }
  .story-text { font-size: 15px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.75; }
  .story-text p + p { margin-top: 16px; }
  .story-text strong { color: var(--black); font-weight: 700; }
  .story-right {}
  .timeline { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0; }
  .timeline-item { display: flex; gap: 20px; padding: 24px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }
  .timeline-item:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
  .timeline-year { font-family: 'Bebas Neue', cursive; font-size: 28px; letter-spacing: 2px; color: var(--orange); flex-shrink: 0; width: 64px; line-height: 1.1; }
  .timeline-content h4 { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--black); margin-bottom: 4px; }
  .timeline-content p { font-size: 13px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; }

  /* NUMBERS */
  .about-numbers { background: var(--black); padding: 80px 48px; }
  .numbers-header { margin-bottom: 48px; }
  .numbers-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 0; }
  .number-item { padding: 32px; border-right: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); }
  .number-item:nth-child(4), .number-item:nth-child(8) { border-right: none; }
  .number-item:nth-child(5), .number-item:nth-child(6), .number-item:nth-child(7), .number-item:nth-child(8) { border-bottom: none; }
  .number-num { font-family: 'Bebas Neue', cursive; font-size: 56px; letter-spacing: 2px; color: var(--orange); line-height: 1; margin-bottom: 6px; }
  .number-label { font-family: 'Barlow', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--white); margin-bottom: 4px; }
  .number-desc { font-size: 12px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.35); line-height: 1.5; }

  /* CAPABILITIES */
  .about-capabilities { padding: 96px 48px; background: var(--gray); }
  .capabilities-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 24px; margin-top: 48px; }
  .capability-card { background: var(--white); padding: 32px; border-radius: 8px; border-left: 4px solid var(--orange); }
  .capability-card h3 { font-family: 'Bebas Neue', cursive; font-size: 24px; letter-spacing: 2px; color: var(--black); margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .capability-card p { font-size: 13px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.6; }

  /* TEAM */
  .about-team { padding: 96px 48px; background: var(--white); }
  .team-card { display: grid; grid-template-columns: auto 1fr; gap: 48px; align-items: center; background: var(--gray); border-radius: 12px; padding: 48px; margin-top: 48px; }
  .team-photo { width: 160px; height: 160px; border-radius: 50%; overflow: hidden; background: var(--border); border: 4px solid var(--orange); flex-shrink: 0; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; }
  .team-photo-placeholder { font-family: 'Bebas Neue', cursive; font-size: 48px; color: var(--orange); letter-spacing: 2px; }
  .team-photo img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; display: block; }
  .team-rank { font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 3px; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--mid-gray); margin-bottom: 6px; }
  .team-info {}
  .team-name { font-family: 'Bebas Neue', cursive; font-size: 40px; letter-spacing: 3px; color: var(--black); line-height: 1; margin-bottom: 4px; }
  .team-title { font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 3px; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--orange); margin-bottom: 16px; }
  .team-bio { font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.7; max-width: 520px; margin-bottom: 20px; }
  .team-contact { display: flex; gap: 16px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .team-contact a { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; color: var(--black); text-decoration: none; letter-spacing: 0.5px; transition: color 0.2s; }
  .team-contact a:hover { color: var(--orange); }

  /* GROUP */
  .about-group { background: var(--orange-pale); padding: 64px 48px; border-top: 3px solid var(--orange); }
  .group-inner { display: flex; gap: 60px; align-items: center; }
  .group-text {}
  .group-text h3 { font-family: 'Bebas Neue', cursive; font-size: 36px; letter-spacing: 3px; color: var(--black); margin-bottom: 12px; }
  .group-text p { font-size: 14px; color: #555; line-height: 1.7; max-width: 480px; }
  .group-stats { display: flex; gap: 32px; flex-shrink: 0; }
  .group-stat { text-align: center; }
  .group-stat-num { font-family: 'Bebas Neue', cursive; font-size: 44px; color: var(--orange); letter-spacing: 2px; line-height: 1; }
  .group-stat-label { font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; font-size: 9px; letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase; color: #888; margin-top: 3px; }

  /* CTA */
  .page-cta { background: var(--orange); padding: 80px 48px; position: relative; overflow: hidden; }
  .page-cta::before { content: ''; position: absolute; top: -80px; right: -80px; width: 400px; height: 400px; border: 80px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); border-radius: 50%; }
  .page-cta-inner { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; position: relative; z-index: 1; gap: 40px; }
  .page-cta h2 { font-family: 'Bebas Neue', cursive; font-size: clamp(44px, 5vw, 68px); letter-spacing: 3px; color: var(--white); line-height: 0.9; margin-bottom: 12px; }
  .page-cta p { font-size: 16px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7); max-width: 440px; line-height: 1.6; }
  .btn-white { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; background: var(--white); color: var(--orange); font-family: 'Barlow', sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase; padding: 14px 28px; border-radius: 3px; text-decoration: none; white-space: nowrap; transition: transform 0.15s; flex-shrink: 0; }
  .btn-white:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); }

  footer { background: var(--black); padding: 32px 48px; }
  .footer-bar { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; }
  .footer-logo-img { height: 36px; width: auto; }
  .footer-links { display: flex; gap: 24px; }
  .footer-links a { font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.3); text-decoration: none; transition: color 0.2s; }
  .footer-links a:hover { color: var(--white); }
  .footer-copy { font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; font-size: 11px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.2); }

  .fade-up { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(28px); transition: opacity 0.6s ease, transform 0.6s ease; }
  .fade-up.visible { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    nav { padding: 0 24px; } .nav-links { display: none; }
    .about-hero-inner { padding: 48px 24px 0; }
    .hero-img-strip { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); height: 160px; }
    .about-story, .about-numbers, .about-capabilities, .about-team, .about-group, .page-cta { padding-left: 24px; padding-right: 24px; }
    .story-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 40px; }
    .numbers-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
    .capabilities-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .team-card { grid-template-columns: 1fr; text-align: center; }
    .team-photo { margin: 0 auto; }
    .team-contact { justify-content: center; }
    .group-inner { flex-direction: column; gap: 32px; }
    .page-cta-inner { flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; }
    footer { padding: 32px 24px; }
    .footer-bar { flex-direction: column; gap: 16px; text-align: center; }
  }
</style>

<div class="about-hero">
  <div class="about-hero-inner">
    <div class="breadcrumb"><a href="../">Home</a> / About</div>
    <h1><span>SINGAPORE'S</span> <span>FIELD<br>MARKETING</span> AGENCY</h1>
    <p>In market since 2010. From a promoter agency to a full-service brand activation and field marketing partner — trusted by Singapore's biggest consumer brands.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="hero-img-strip">
    <div class="hero-img-strip-item"><img src="/assets/meiji-1.jpg" alt="Meiji roadshow" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high"></div>
    <div class="hero-img-strip-item"><img src="/assets/perrier-2.jpg" alt="Perrier activation" loading="lazy"></div>
    <div class="hero-img-strip-item"><img src="/assets/carlsberg-2.jpg" alt="Carlsberg activation" loading="lazy"></div>
    <div class="hero-img-strip-item"><img src="/assets/outdoor-3.jpg" alt="Outdoor activation" loading="lazy"></div>
  </div>
</div>

<section class="about-story fade-up">
  <div class="story-grid">
    <div class="story-left">
      <div class="section-kicker">Our Story</div>
      <h2 class="section-h2">FROM <span>PROMOTER AGENCY</span> TO INTEGRATION PARTNER</h2>
      <div class="story-text">
        <p>Elitez FMCG started in 2010 as a promoter deployment agency — placing part-time promoters in supermarkets and retail outlets across Singapore. We were good at it. We built a trusted roster, developed disciplined operations, and grew our client base steadily.</p>
        <p>By 2020, we had evolved. Clients weren't just asking for bodies on the ground — they wanted <strong>visibility, accountability and results</strong>. So we became an integration agency: field marketing, digital components, real-time reporting, all under one roof.</p>
        <p>That evolution led to <strong>BLINK</strong> — our proprietary operations platform that now powers every campaign we run. It's what separates us from every other promoter agency in Singapore.</p>
        <p>Today we manage over <strong>300 promoters every week</strong>, serve MNC clients like P&G, Reckitt, Carlsberg and Unilever, and operate out of a 5,000 sqft warehouse that handles logistics for every activation we run.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="story-right">
      <div class="timeline">
        <div class="timeline-item">
          <div class="timeline-year">2010</div>
          <div class="timeline-content"><h4>Founded as a promoter agency</h4><p>Began deploying part-time promoters to supermarkets and FMCG retail activations across Singapore.</p></div>
        </div>
        <div class="timeline-item">
          <div class="timeline-year">2015</div>
          <div class="timeline-content"><h4>Scaled to 500+ roster promoters</h4><p>Expanded WSQ training programme and grew client base to include major MNC FMCG brands.</p></div>
        </div>
        <div class="timeline-item">
          <div class="timeline-year">2018</div>
          <div class="timeline-content"><h4>5,000 sqft warehouse commissioned</h4><p>Brought logistics in-house — POS materials, premiums and equipment now managed end-to-end.</p></div>
        </div>
        <div class="timeline-item">
          <div class="timeline-year">2020</div>
          <div class="timeline-content"><h4>Evolution to integration agency</h4><p>Added digital campaign capabilities and began building BLINK — our proprietary ops platform.</p></div>
        </div>
        <div class="timeline-item">
          <div class="timeline-year">2025</div>
          <div class="timeline-content"><h4>BLINK platform launched to clients</h4><p>Full client portal live — real-time deployment visibility, live sales data, automated reporting.</p></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="about-numbers">
  <div class="numbers-header fade-up">
    <div class="section-kicker" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.4);">By the Numbers</div>
    <h2 style="font-family:'Bebas Neue',cursive;font-size:clamp(40px,4vw,56px);letter-spacing:3px;color:var(--white);line-height:1;">THE SCALE BEHIND <span style="color:var(--orange);">EVERY CAMPAIGN</span></h2>
  </div>
  <div class="numbers-grid fade-up">
    <div class="number-item"><div class="number-num">300+</div><div class="number-label">Promoters Deployed Weekly</div><div class="number-desc">Across supermarkets, malls and retail channels in Singapore</div></div>
    <div class="number-item"><div class="number-num">1,000+</div><div class="number-label">WSQ-Trained on Roster</div><div class="number-desc">Active promoters trained across all major FMCG categories</div></div>
    <div class="number-item"><div class="number-num">15+</div><div class="number-label">Years in Market</div><div class="number-desc">Established in 2010, consistently serving Singapore's top consumer brands</div></div>
    <div class="number-item"><div class="number-num">5,000sqft</div><div class="number-label">In-House Warehouse</div><div class="number-desc">For POS materials, premiums, uniforms and campaign logistics</div></div>
    <div class="number-item"><div class="number-num">10+</div><div class="number-label">MNC Clients</div><div class="number-desc">Including P&G, Reckitt, Carlsberg, Unilever and Energizer</div></div>
    <div class="number-item"><div class="number-num">100%</div><div class="number-label">Quiz Pass Rate Required</div><div class="number-desc">Every promoter must pass your product quiz before stepping on the ground</div></div>
    <div class="number-item"><div class="number-num">1</div><div class="number-label">Proprietary Platform</div><div class="number-desc">BLINK — built in-house, purpose-built for FMCG promoter campaigns</div></div>
    <div class="number-item"><div class="number-num">6</div><div class="number-label">Countries in the Group</div><div class="number-desc">Elitez Group operates across Singapore, Malaysia, Indonesia and beyond</div></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="about-capabilities fade-up">
  <div class="section-kicker">What Sets Us Apart</div>
  <h2 class="section-h2">OUR <span>CAPABILITIES</span></h2>
  <div class="capabilities-grid">
    <div class="capability-card"><h3>In-House Logistics</h3><p>5,000 sqft warehouse. We pack, deliver, and collect every campaign's materials — POS, premiums, uniforms, equipment.</p></div>
    <div class="capability-card"><h3>Proprietary Tech</h3><p>BLINK platform for real-time promoter management, client dashboards, live sales data and automated reporting.</p></div>
    <div class="capability-card"><h3>WSQ Training</h3><p>Every promoter on our roster is WSQ-trained. Category-specific product quizzes must be passed before any shift starts.</p></div>
    <div class="capability-card"><h3>Compliance-First HR</h3><p>MOM-compliant documentation, CPF processing, PDPA-compliant data handling — for every single promoter we deploy.</p></div>
    <div class="capability-card"><h3>Full-Campaign Management</h3><p>From brief to post-project evaluation — we manage planning, deployment, reporting and wrap-up in one team.</p></div>
    <div class="capability-card"><h3>Digital Integration</h3><p>QR mechanics, microsites, social content capture and KOL coordination — physical activations extended online.</p></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="about-team fade-up">
  <div class="section-kicker">The Team</div>
  <h2 class="section-h2">MEET YOUR <span>POINT OF CONTACT</span></h2>

  <div class="team-card">
    <div class="team-photo">
      <img src="/assets/img/photo-eevann.jpg" alt="Eevann Seah" loading="lazy">
    </div>
    <div class="team-info">
      <div class="team-rank">01 — Business Unit Leader</div>
      <div class="team-name">EEVANN SEAH</div>
      <div class="team-title">Associate Director, Elitez FMCG</div>
      <p class="team-bio">A former RSAF Air Force Officer turned brand activation specialist, Eevann leads Elitez FMCG with a sharp operational mind and a deep understanding of what it takes to drive results on the ground. He oversees every client relationship, campaign strategy and platform development — and is your direct contact for any new project or enquiry.</p>
      <div class="team-contact">
        <a href="mailto:eevann.seah@elitez.asia">✉ eevann.seah@elitez.asia</a>
        <a href="tel:+6581800994">📞 +65 8180 0994</a>
        <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/eevann-seah-a68a63148/" target="_blank">🔗 LinkedIn ↗</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="team-card">
    <div class="team-photo">
      <img src="/assets/img/photo-jorena.jpg" alt="Jorena Tan" loading="lazy">
    </div>
    <div class="team-info">
      <div class="team-rank">02 — Second in Charge</div>
      <div class="team-name">JORENA TAN</div>
      <div class="team-title">Assistant Manager, Elitez FMCG</div>
      <p class="team-bio">Jorena is the kind of account lead every brand wishes they had — equal parts creative thinker and meticulous executor. She takes your brief and runs with it, bridging the gap between your vision and what actually happens on the ground. Working hand-in-hand with the operations team, she holds every moving part accountable — from promoter briefings and costume sourcing to outlet logistics and real-time troubleshooting — so that the activation you imagined is the activation that gets delivered.</p>
      <div class="team-contact">
        <a href="mailto:jorena.tan@elitez.asia">✉ jorena.tan@elitez.asia</a>
        <a href="tel:+6583337613">📞 +65 8333 7613</a>
        <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/jorena-tan-1a060214b/" target="_blank">🔗 LinkedIn ↗</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="team-card">
    <div class="team-photo">
      <img src="/assets/img/photo-sam.jpg" alt="Sam Neo" loading="lazy">
    </div>
    <div class="team-info">
      <div class="team-rank">03 — Third in Charge</div>
